`createPaymentIntent` uses `getTripById` which calls ensureTripSchema. Good.

Need `metadata` JSON: use `JSON.stringify`; Drizzle `sql` parameter for jsonb: `${JSON.stringify(metadata)}::jsonb` maybe. Use `${JSON.stringify(metadata)}` with column jsonb; Postgres will cast text? Drizzle sends parameter, Postgres infers unknown to jsonb maybe. Use `CAST(${JSON.stringify(metadata)} AS jsonb)`.

Need row mapping handles `metadata` object or string.

Amount handling: `trip.totalEstimate` numeric from map as number. Good.

Need `reference` unique. Add unique index.

